# NOTE: data/ground_truth/answer_key.json is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It is committed so reviewers can verify the scoring themselves. The isolation
# guarantee is enforced in code, not by hiding the file:
#   - only run_analysis.py reads it, and only at the final scoring step
#   - tests/test_pipeline.py::test_ground_truth_not_read_by_analysis_modules
#     fails the build if any analysis module references it
#   - see data/ground_truth/README.md for the Project-2 agent contract
